  "comments": "<p>Released in the coronation year of King Charles III, the designs feature eight brand-new reverse designs that pay tribute to King Charles III, the four nations of the United Kingdom and the natural world.<br><br>The 2023 coins were issued in a Brilliant Uncirculated Set (31,446), Brilliant Uncirculated Definitive Set (200,537), a BU historic set which included a set of 1948 coinage (issue limit: 2,023; sales 2,023) a first and last BU set (sales unknown) as well as in Definitive Base Proof &nbsp;Set (Issue limit: 12,023; sales 11,927), &nbsp;Proof Commemorative Set (issue limit: 7,500; sales 7,480), and a Premium Proof Set (issue limit: 2,750; &nbsp;sales 2,745)<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/652c5617b0304.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/652c5617b0304.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/652c56216472a.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/652c56216472a.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/652c5657324d5.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/652c5657324d5.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/652c56dd24b18.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/652c56dd24b18.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>© The Royal Mint, 2023<br><br>The 2023 coins issued in the Brilliant Uncirculated &amp; Proof Sets featured a special Tudor crown privy mark. The coins that enter circulation will not feature the privy mark.&nbsp;<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/652c530062f5e.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/652c530062f5e.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>© The Royal Mint, 2023<br>&nbsp;</p><p>The 2024 coin was issued as part of the Annual Commemorative Proof (7,500 issue limit), Premium Commemorative Proof (2,024 issue limit) and Brilliant Uncirculated Commemorative sets.</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/659dfc486604a.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/659dfc486604a.jpg\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/659dfc5744f42.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/659dfc5744f42.jpg\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/659dfc5da495e.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/659dfc5da495e.jpg\"></a></p><p>© The Royal Mint, 2024</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The 2025 coin was issued as part of the Annual Commemorative Proof (7,500 issue limit), Premium Commemorative Proof (2,024 issue limit) and the Brilliant Uncirculated strike was in Commemorative sets.&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6783d0ad3b2a2.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6783d0ad3b2a2.jpg\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6783d0bc589aa.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6783d0bc589aa.jpg\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6783d0c474cdf.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6783d0c474cdf.jpg\"></a></p><p>© The Royal Mint, 2025</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The 2026 coin was issued as part of the Annual Commemorative Proof set (6,500 issue limit), Premium Commemorative Proof set (2,000 issue limit) and the Brilliant Uncirculated strike was in the Definitive set, the Annual set and the Baby Set.</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/695f5cf6ba3a0.webp\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/695f5cf6ba3a0.webp\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/695f5d04df9e1.webp\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/695f5d04df9e1.webp\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/695f5d14e6368.webp\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/695f5d14e6368.webp\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/695f5d2057014.webp\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/695f5d2057014.webp\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/695f5d2d252fc.webp\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/695f5d2d252fc.webp\"></a></p><p>© The Royal Mint, 2026</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The design was also struck in silver proof and gold proof.</p>",
